{
  "name": "Write a personal first line with your own AI for each sheet row and add the person to a campaign",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Write a personal first line with your own AI for each sheet row and add the person to a campaign\n\n### How it works\nSpecific first lines at the pace of a spreadsheet. Each new row holds email, first_name, company and notes (anything your team found: a hire, an office, a post). Your own AI model writes one opening line of at most 25 words from the notes, without flattery or made-up facts. The person is added to your campaign with first_line as a variable; write {{first_line|Hope the quarter is going well.}} in your first email so people without a line still get a good opener. Argorant checks the address and only valid emails join. The row gets the line and the result.\n\nYour own rows cost no Argorant credits.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the community node **n8n-nodes-argorant** (tested with 0.3.0 on n8n 2.46.6): Settings > Community nodes > Install. Guide: https://github.com/argorant/n8n-nodes-argorant\n2. Add an **Argorant API** credential with a key from Argorant (Settings, API keys).\n3. Create a sheet with the columns email, first_name, company, notes, first_line, status and pick it in **New row** and **Write back**.\n4. Pick the campaign in **Add to campaign** and write {{first_line|...}} into its first email.\n5. Pick a chat model (any chat model node works) and activate.\n\n### Customization\nChange the tone or length in **Write the first line**.",
        "height": 670,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "4c5d5762-6aa0-4874-943f-8441780f1912",
